{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/660349-9-11-01","id":660349,"title":"9/11/01","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-10T22:32:13-07:00","id":660349,"title":"9/11/01","content":"I'm copying over a post I made on Facebook, consider the request embedded in the post to be an official moderator request. Thank You.<br /> <br /> &quot;So it's officially 9/11 here now and I ask a favor from my friends, acquaintances and anyone else reading this post. This day is about remembering the victims of the worst terrorist attack the US has seen. It's not about the military or politicians, it's about the civilians who died. Don't post finger-pointing, blame-shifting partisan memes. If you were fortunate enough not to have lost anyone you cared about that day respect the feelings of those who have.<br /> <br /> Today I am taking a break from any political posts or memes that aren't specifically about honoring the lives lost out of respect for those people and I politely request you do the same.&quot;<br /> <br /> Those few lines took me an hour to post because I'm one of those people that lost a loved one when the Towers fell and it's still difficult for me not to cry and become white hot angry because my stepsister lost her husband, my nieces lost their dad, and I lost a very close, dear friend. I normally don't share personal feelings on the forum, I prefer to keep my posts light and/or helpful but this day is the one exception I normally allow myself. Anyone else with a similar experience has my condolences.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}